  "pathBeforeYouBegin": [
    "### Before you begin\n\nBefore you connect to Amazon CloudWatch, ensure you have:\n\n- A Grafana Cloud account. To create an account, refer to [Grafana Cloud](https://grafana.com/signup/cloud/connect-account).\n- An AWS account with CloudWatch metrics or logs to query.\n- Permission to create IAM roles and policies in your AWS account (the `Organization administrator` role in Grafana is required to configure the data source).\n- Familiarity with the AWS region your resources run in."
  ],
  "milestones": [
    {
