      "dir": "cloudwatch-data-source-lj/prepare-permissions",
      "requirements": {},
      "navigate": [],
      "needsText": [
        "### Choose the permissions you need\n\nAttach one of the following policies to the IAM role, depending on what you plan to query:\n\n- **Metrics only** \u2014 read CloudWatch metrics plus EC2 tags, instances, and regions.\n- **Logs only** \u2014 read CloudWatch Logs plus EC2 tags, instances, and regions.\n- **Metrics and logs** \u2014 read both.\n\nThe metrics-and-logs policy is shown below. For the metrics-only and logs-only variants and the cross-account observability policy, refer to [Configure the CloudWatch data source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/datasources/aws-cloudwatch/configure/#iam-policy-examples)."
      ]
    },
